{"name": "Gothic Hell: Survivors", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/b3c361b125227d9e46a31eafa9934f4d.poster.avif?t=1786389528\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/b3c361b125227d9e46a31eafa9934f4d.webm?t=1786389528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/b3c361b125227d9e46a31eafa9934f4d.mp4?t=1786389528\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><strong>Gothic Hell: Survivors</strong> is top-down gothic chaos. Runs last 10-15 minutes, with loot management and meta progression between them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Built for <strong>multiplayer</strong>, focused on <strong>single player</strong> at launch.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CHOOSE A SURVIVOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"91\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/12a09653194557c05cf730c1157467ab.avif?t=1786389528\" width=\"616\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Each survivor changes how a run plays. Their signature ability decides which spells you chase and how the horde dies.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LEARN POWERFUL SPELLS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/32fc3c6ba15ae9f601d2d1ae76477af8.poster.avif?t=1786389528\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/32fc3c6ba15ae9f601d2d1ae76477af8.webm?t=1786389528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/32fc3c6ba15ae9f601d2d1ae76477af8.mp4?t=1786389528\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Spells cast themselves. Your hands are on movement, timing, and the build. Stack synergies, unlock new survivors and passive boosts between runs, and climb arenas built in real 3D. The best secrets take climbing to reach.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KILL BIG BOSS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/645f7fabdc447fcf857dbf8f45d030aa.poster.avif?t=1786389528\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/645f7fabdc447fcf857dbf8f45d030aa.webm?t=1786389528\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/extras/645f7fabdc447fcf857dbf8f45d030aa.mp4?t=1786389528\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>...or DIE.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bullet heaven ARPG with auto-cast spells</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>Loot? A lot!</u></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meta progression between runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each survivor's signature ability rewrites the run</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vertical 3D arenas packed with secrets and shifting layouts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spell synergies that stack into broken builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedural encounters with a handcrafted look</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gothic horror world with stylized art and haunting sound</p></li></ul> </div>", "short_desc": "Break the game. We won't stop you. Fuse spells into synergies that erase the swarm, climb gothic arenas where bosses wait above and secrets hide below, then drag your haul home and build something worse. A bullet heaven roguelite where stupidly overpowered is the goal.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3727710/b3c214ed8dd5705fd1f740db0b9e4d5fa6c69174/header.jpg?t=1786389528", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Bullet Heaven", "Bullet Hell", "Action", "Loot", "Gothic", "Action RPG"], "developers": "KIB Games, Vibe Labs", "publishers": "KIB Games, Vibe Labs", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3727710", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "30 July 2025 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/svfX9IVA4G0", "first_seen": 1753826400.0, "review_rank": 1541}